 R←Test_Misc_002(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;hash1;hash2
⍝ Hash a password without a salt, and without initializing first.
⍝ The comparison itself is pretty meaningless; what matters is that `Hash` initializes itself.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 ##.HashPasswords.Dispose

 hash1←##.HashPasswords.Hash'MySecretPassword'
 hash2←##.HashPasswords.Hash'MySecretPassword'
 →T.PassesIf hash1≡hash2

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
